The scanners define their own yywrap, do not require it from a lex library,
configure gave up on flex when the yywrap link test failed.

--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -73,7 +73,7 @@
 AC_PROG_RANLIB
 AC_PROG_MAKE_SET
 AC_PROG_YACC
-AC_PROG_LEX(yywrap)
+AC_PROG_LEX(noyywrap)
 
 AC_CHECK_PROG(LIBTOOL,libtool,libtool)
 
